OL,6,     FStill haunted by the tragedy that
OL,7,     Fshattered his life 10 years
OL,8,     Fearlier, Dr Ethan Winter is called
OL,9,     Fto a gruesome crime scene at a
OL,10,     FBristol demolition site. The
OL,11,     Fvictim, a man in his fifties,
OL,12,     Fappears to be a construction
OL,13,     Fworker with catastrophic head
OL,14,     Finjuries - but there's one
OL,15,     Fhorrifying detail no one can
OL,16,     Fexplain: his face has been peeled
OL,17,     Faway. Using his unique forensic
OL,18,     Finsight, Winter quickly
OL,19,     Festablishes the victim never
OL,20,     Fworked on the site and that his
OL,21,     Fbody was dumped there after death.
